{"id": "sdqa0184", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3901567365, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "55d54790f4984a1399d890ed29cf337bf030dd977d2cbf354d2e7727784c1c44", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "What's the largest recorded squid?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0184.wav", "input_sha256": "4373c1e976a1d1ebc98058ad53eb5332ab09704d9b6078241a8bc62757cfbd94", "input_samples": 51877, "input_s": 3.242, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7149, "act": 0.9979, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The largest recorded squid by mass is the colossal squid (Mesonychoteuthis hamiltoni). , Heaviest confirmed specimen: about 495 kg (1,091 lb) , Length: roughly 10 m (33 ft) including tentacles , It was caught near Antarctica in 2007. If measuring by total length, the giant squid (Architeuthis dux) may be longer, with verified specimens around 12–13 m (39–43 ft), but it is much lighter than the colossal squid.", "expert_answer": "The **largest recorded squid by mass** is the **colossal squid** (*Mesonychoteuthis hamiltoni*).\n\n- **Heaviest confirmed specimen:** about **495 kg (1,091 lb)**\n- **Length:** roughly **10 m (33 ft)** including tentacles\n- It was caught near **Antarctica** in 2007.\n\nIf measuring by **total length**, the **giant squid** (*Architeuthis dux*) may be longer, with verified specimens around **12–13 m (39–43 ft)**, but it is much lighter than the colossal squid.", "transcript": "What's the largest recorded squid?\n", "asr_s": 0.47, "expert_s": 4.94, "expert_input_samples": 51877, "expert_input_s": 3.242, "expert_input_sha256": "4373c1e976a1d1ebc98058ad53eb5332ab09704d9b6078241a8bc62757cfbd94", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.207, "relay_synth_ms": 21109, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 210, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 210, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0184_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "99f1749bba7e33ee0621ab3e2f69d7a973b853256d90805cf5c03871bfd26914", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 37.56}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0184_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "cab760a38525530ff92d526f0280b3809fcdfd6eb8d43d7180c2335e5fe64fdc", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0184_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "4cfe33d8d0a0f147c5d9d98069a9432909f261fc16ccaa5aa05d3a27f4ff7cb6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.137, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.08, 2.141, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.074, 3.135, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.242, 3.309, 3.848, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.242, 4.523, 5.051, 0, 29760, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.242, "last_real_feed_done": 3.309, "onset": 3.848, "gate_read_done": 3.849, "fire": 3.849, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.848, "stall_note": 3.85, "stall_first_pcm": 4.452, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.051, "expert_req": 3.85, "expert_resp": 9.257, "relay_synth_start": 9.258, "relay_first_pcm": 10.074, "relay_synth_end": 30.367, "first_any_pcm": 3.848, "first_answer_pcm": 10.074, "session_end": 30.74}, "ttfa_answer_s": 6.832, "ttfa_any_s": 0.606}
